# NAME: Anthropic Full
# BASE AUTHOR: blackmatrix7
# BASE REPO: https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script
# CHECKED: 2026-10-13
# FORMAT: Quantumult X
# HOST: 19
# HOST-SUFFIX: 9
# TOTAL: 28
# Includes dedicated domains and shared third-party dependencies.
# Shared hosts also route unrelated traffic through the Anthropic policy.
# Replace Anthropic with your actual policy name if necessary.
# Community-only entries are marked below; optional telemetry stays commented.
# Sources and limits: Anthropic-review.md.

# Original rules retained
HOST,servd-anthropic-website.b-cdn.net,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.ai,Anthropic

# Official network documentation: web, authentication, desktop preview,
# Artifacts / Chrome bridge, and MCP interactive content.
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.com,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.app,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com,Anthropic

# Developer blog linked from the official Claude homepage
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.dev,Anthropic

# Community-maintained Anthropic entries (v2fly domain-list-community).
# These two are not listed in the official network documentation checked.
# First-party ownership / endpoint use was not independently verified.
HOST-SUFFIX,clau.de,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com,Anthropic

# Shared dependencies (included in this full version)
# Artifacts: official network documentation lists these fonts / library hosts.
HOST,fonts.googleapis.com,Anthropic
HOST,fonts.gstatic.com,Anthropic
HOST,cdnjs.cloudflare.com,Anthropic
HOST,cdn.jsdelivr.net,Anthropic
HOST,cdn.tailwindcss.com,Anthropic
HOST,code.jquery.com,Anthropic
HOST,unpkg.com,Anthropic

# Help center: resources / configuration observed in its official HTML.
HOST,static.intercomassets.com,Anthropic
HOST,downloads.intercomcdn.com,Anthropic
HOST,widget.intercom.io,Anthropic
HOST,api-iam.intercom.io,Anthropic

# Corporate homepage: script / stylesheet resources observed in official HTML.
HOST,cdn.prod.website-files.com,Anthropic
HOST,d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net,Anthropic

# Claude Code: conditional installation, plugin, changelog and update hosts.
# storage.googleapis.com is also used for plugin metadata; old installers use it.
HOST,storage.googleapis.com,Anthropic
HOST,registry.npmjs.org,Anthropic
HOST,github.com,Anthropic
HOST,raw.githubusercontent.com,Anthropic
HOST,formulae.brew.sh,Anthropic

# Optional Claude Code telemetry: disabled here; uncomment only if wanted.
# HOST,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com,Anthropic
# HOST,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com,Anthropic
